  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Season the red snapper fillets with sea salt, cumin, and smoked paprika.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, and a pinch of sea salt to make the glaze.",
    "Grill the mussels and shrimp for 2-3 minutes per side, or until they are cooked through.",
    "Brush the glaze on the red snapper fillets during the last minute of grilling.",
    "Let the seafood rest for a few minutes before serving.",
